Forage
Copyright 2026 Ydefix / Init & Co.

This product adapts the stateful search-harness design of harness-1
(Pengcheng Jiang et al., 2026 — https://github.com/pat-jj/harness-1,
arXiv 2606.02373), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The Forage implementation targets locally-served Qwen3.6 / Gemma models
via OpenAI-compatible endpoints (e.g. oMLX) on Apple Silicon.

The name "Forage" is a reference to Information Foraging Theory
(Pirolli & Card, Xerox PARC).
